 id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2; 3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 2.2.17(a′) iff (c′); Proposition 3.1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>101</span><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement compared in supplied DjVu OCR; both directions supplied and checked locally, not a separately printed proof"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-2.1.5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (elementary diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}\\)</span> (model-class operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary-embedding class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B^+\\!\\upharpoonright L\">\\(\\mathfrak B^+\\!\\upharpoonright L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-reduct of an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak B^+\\in\n\\operatorname{Mod}(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A))\\;\n(\\mathfrak B^+\\!\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak B)\n\\Bigr]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak B^+\\in\n\\operatorname{Mod}(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A))\\;\n(\\mathfrak B^+\\!\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak B)\n\\Bigr]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 2.2.17(a′)⇔(c′)，并见 Proposition 3.1.3。原书前者只陈述此类比，未在该处另列证明。局部证明：由命名扩张取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)=c_a^{\\mathfrak B^+}\">\\(f(a)=c_a^{\\mathfrak B^+}\\)</span>，对每个公式及有限元组，把它和它的否定视为命名语言中的句子；初等图示使两边真值相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是初等嵌入。反向按初等嵌入解释常元，全部真命名句均保持。总赋值版本由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a> 的接口给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","a